NODE id=matrix/executor/runtime.SkillReloader.initialScan kind=method
  digest=b3:6dcf309687e0f9188960f6bb772a3f17ce1b822c3c9d562149d1c2143928e9c1 file=executor/runtime/skill_reload.go range=214:232 lang=go exported=false byte_range=7228:7802
  sig=func (r *SkillReloader) initialScan()
  doc=initialScan parses every SKILL.mtx currently under the root into the live\nregistry. Invalid skills are skipped (with an error recorded). This makes\nthe live registry warm right after Start, mirroring what the daemon's\nskillCatalog.ensureLoaded does on first hit.
