NODE id=matrix/executor/runtime.SkillReloader.loop kind=method
  digest=b3:866b461ebc9bb31bc2f37ae1d7f978928866dd06c76b165caedf092075720feb file=executor/runtime/skill_reload.go range=234:262 lang=go exported=false byte_range=7804:8609
  sig=func (r *SkillReloader) loop(w *fsnotify.Watcher)
  doc=loop is the watcher goroutine. It drains fsnotify events + errors until\nClose is called. Invalid re-parses are recorded and dropped; the loop\nnever exits due to a parse failure (acceptance: invalid edits never crash).
